    "oneKeyHowToApply": "🔑 How to apply for API Key",
    "oneKeyTongyiItem1": "<b>Text/Chat</b>: Tongyi Qwen (qwen-plus) — story script generation",
    "oneKeyTongyiItem2": "<b>Text to Image</b>: Tongyi Wanxiang (wan2.6-image) — character/scene/prop images",
